      en: ["Lhuntse Dzong was originally constructed in the year 1654.", "Lhuntse is recognized as the ancestral home of the Wangchuck dynasty.", "The region is famous for producing high-quality Kishuthara textiles.", "The Guru Rinpoche statue in Takila stands 47 meters tall.", "The town overlooks the Kuri Chhu, a major river in eastern Bhutan.", "Khoma village is the renowned center for intricate silk weaving."],
