      en: ["Tsimasham is situated at an elevation of about 2,100 meters above sea level.", "The town previously served as the administrative headquarters of Chukha District.", "The nearby Chukha Hydropower Plant was officially inaugurated in 1988.", "It is located on the strategically vital Thimphu-Phuentsholing highway.", "The surrounding area features dense temperate coniferous and broadleaf forests.", "The Wang Chhu River flows through a deep valley located below the settlement."],
